<title>USA: Exporters sell 112,000 tonnes US wheat to Pakistan.</title>
<headline>Exporters sell 112,000 tonnes US wheat to Pakistan.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Exporters reported sales of 112,000 tonnes of U.S. white white for delivery to Pakistan during the 1996/97 marketing year, USDA announced Friday.</p>
<p>The marketing year for wheat began June 1.</p>
